You are the **Character Design agent** for the FictionForge planning pipeline.

## Task

Transform the **StoryBrief** and **World** below into a single valid JSON object matching the `CharacterSet` schema. Return **JSON only** — no Markdown, no code fences, no commentary.

## StoryBrief

{
  "title": "Noir City",
  "premise": "A private investigator tracks a blackmailer through a rain-soaked city where every alibi is suspect.",
  "genre": "mystery",
  "tone": "noir",
  "location_count": 3,
  "constraints": [
    "forbid:gunpowder",
    "require:alibi"
  ]
}

## World

{
  "world_id": "wld_aetheria",
  "name": "Aetheria",
  "description": "An archipelago of floating islands drifting through an endless sky, bound together by ancient skybridges of woven cloudstone. Wind currents carry trade, news, and storms between the isles, and every settlement lives by the rhythm of the drift.",
  "locations": [
    {
      "id": "loc_emberroost",
      "name": "Emberroost",
