ion.","external_conflict":"Doran demands the maps for Cartel use, while the shifting jungle destroys his survey marks.","arc":"Tobias starts as a naive scholar who values the chart above all. When a landmark he marked sinks into the growth and nearly kills Mara, he abandons a precious survey to save her. He ends as a mapmaker who values lives over glory.","personality_traits":["curious","earnest","anxious","brilliant"],"abilities":[{"name":"Survey Instruments","description":"Uses brass sighting tools to fix positions even where the terrain keeps changing.","category":"technological"}]},{"id":"chr_isolde_harrow","name":"Isolde Harrow","role":"supporting","description":"A stoic Hollow Circle miller turned expedition cook and quartermaster, with strong forearms and a braid of grey-streaked hair. She joined because the Cartel's grain levy is ruining her family's mill.","home_location_id":"loc_the_hollow","faction_id":"fac_hollow_circle","motivation":"She wants wages and spoils to save her family's mill from the Grain Levy.","goal":"Keep the party fed and bring home her share of the salvage.","flaw":"She holds grudges and refuses to forgive anyone tied to the Cartel.","internal_conflict":"She needs Doran's payment to survive, but despises taking it.","external_conflict":"The Cartel's levy threatens her family while Doran controls her payment.","arc":"Isolde begins as a bitter hired hand who keeps her distance. When the jungle strands the party with little food, she rations supplies equally, even sharing with Doran's guards, to keep everyone alive. She ends as a woman who can set aside old grudges for survival.","personality_traits":["stoic","practical","stubborn","protective"],"abilities":[{"name":"Foraging Lore","description":"Finds safe food and water in unfamiliar growth, drawing on years of farm knowledge.","category":"physical"}]}],"relationships":[{"id":"rel_mara_doran_debt","source_character_id":"chr_doran_kest","target_character_id":"chr_mara_venn","relationship_