pect charts, he chooses to testify rather than sabotage. He ends as a patient advocate who wins his village a hearing.","personality_traits":["warm","impulsive","loyal","blunt"],"abilities":[{"name":"Grain Reckoning","description":"Quickly estimates harvests, yields and fair prices.","category":"mental"}]}],"relationships":[{"id":"rel_mara_sable_rivalry","source_character_id":"chr_mara_veln","target_character_id":"chr_sable_quill","relationship_type":"enemy","description":"Mara Veln is investigating Sable Quill's suppression of unsafe skybridge records, and Sable regards Mara as a threat to the Cartel's toll revenue."},{"id":"rel_mara_dorrin_colleagues","source_character_id":"chr_mara_veln","target_character_id":"chr_dorrin_ashk","relationship_type":"ally","description":"Mara Veln reluctantly relies on Dorrin Ashk's expertise to verify the forged charts, while his hesitation frustrates her."},{"id":"rel_sable_dorrin_pressure","source_character_id":"chr_sable_quill","target_character_id":"chr_dorrin_ashk","relationship_type":"rival","description":"Sable Quill pressures Dorrin Ashk through Cartel-funded patrons to approve altered charts, forcing him to choose between the Academy and the truth."},{"id":"rel_tobin_sable_levy","source_character_id":"chr_tobin_reeve","target_character_id":"chr_sable_quill","relationship_type":"enemy","description":"Tobin Reeve opposes Sable Quill's Grain Levy, which threatens to ruin the millers of The Hollow."},{"id":"rel_tobin_mara_allies","source_character_id":"chr_tobin_reeve","target_character_id":"chr_mara_veln","relationship_type":"ally","description":"Tobin Reeve and Mara Veln form a wary alliance, trading Mara's chart evidence for Tobin's testimony against the Cartel."}]}
