ned hands and a limp from an old cable snap. Based at Silverspine Academy, she teaches bridge-mapping to apprentices and quietly tracks the network's weakest spans.","home_location_id":"loc_silverspine","faction_id":"fac_bridge_wardens","motivation":"To keep the skybridges safe from the strain of Cartel tolls and neglect.","goal":"Secure Warden control of bridge maintenance funding independent of Cartel tolls.","flaw":"Her rigid devotion to Warden rules makes her slow to bend, even when lives depend on it.","internal_conflict":"She wants to protect the bridges but resents that doing so means relying on the Cartel's money.","external_conflict":"The Toll War drains Warden resources while the Cartel pressures her superiors to hand over maintenance authority.","arc":"Maren begins as a rule-bound teacher who refuses to help outlaws. When a Cartel blockade leaves a damaged span near Silverspine at risk, she chooses to give Kest safe passage in exchange for map data. She ends willing to bend rules to protect the network.","personality_traits":["methodical","protective","stern","patient"],"abilities":[{"name":"Span Assessment","description":"Reads cloudstone fatigue to predict which bridges are close to failing.","category":"mental"},{"name":"Cable Repair","description":"Splices and braids damaged skybridge cables in the field.","category":"physical"}]},{"id":"chr_juno_hale","name":"Juno Hale","role":"supporting","description":"A young miller's daughter from The Hollow, freckled and quick, who runs grain barges and quietly passes messages for the Hollow Circle. She is wary of outsiders but loyal to her neighbors.","home_location_id":"loc_the_hollow","faction_id":"fac_hollow_circle","motivation":"To protect her village from the Cartel's grain levy and the hunger it threatens.","goal":"Organize the Hollow Circle to refuse the levy without triggering Cartel reprisals.","flaw":"She is impulsive and acts on anger before weighing consequences for others.","internal_conflict":"She wants to stay safe at home but feels cowardly for not fighting back.","external_conflict":"The Cartel's Grain Levy threatens her village's stores, and Cartel inspectors press on the Hollow's barges.","arc":"Juno starts as an angry messenger who wants to strike back recklessly. After Kest shows her the Cartel's levy records, she chooses to shelter Kest and publicly back the Circle's refusal instead of staging a blockade. She ends as a steadier organizer who weighs consequences before acting.","personality_traits":["impulsive","loyal","quick-tempered","brave"],"abilities":[{"name":"Barge Piloting","description":"Navigates grain barges through crosswinds and narrow channels.","category":"physical"},{"name":"Village Networks","description":"Moves messages quickly through trusted farming families.","category":"social"}]}],"relationships":[{"id":"rel_orsin_hunts_kest","source_character_id":"chr_orsin_dray","target_character_id":"chr_kest_varan","relationship_type":"enemy","description":"Orsin Dray hunts Kest Varan with Cartel resources to recover the stolen Ledger Seed, while Kest sees him as the face of the debt system that ruined her family."},{"id":"rel_kest_wins_maren","source_character_id":"chr_kest_varan","target_character_id":"chr_maren_tolliver","relationship_type":"ally","description":"Kest Varan trades bridge-ledger knowledge to Maren Tolliver in exchange for safe passage, a wary alliance built on their shared hatred of Cartel tolls."},{"id":"rel_juno_shelters_kest","source_character_id":"chr_juno_hale","target_character_id":"chr_kest_varan","relationship_type":"ally","description":"Juno Hale shelters Kest Varan in The Hollow after learning the Seed can expose the Grain Levy, which puts Juno's village at risk of Cartel reprisal."},{"id":"rel_orsin_squeezes_maren","source_character_id":"chr_orsin_dray","target_character_id":"chr_maren_tolliver","relationship_type":"rival","description":"Orsin Dray pressures Maren Tolliver and her Warden superiors to surrender maintenance authority, and Maren resists, deepening the Toll War."},{"id":"rel_orsin_levies_juno","source_character_id":"chr_orsin_dray","target_character_id":"chr_juno_hale","relationship_type":"enemy","description":"Orsin Dray enforces the Grain Levy on Juno Hale's village, and Juno resists as a messenger for the Hollow Circle."}]}
