pose. When the manor's bridge anchor is found tampered with, she chooses to reveal her mission to Odette instead of reporting only to the Wardens. She ends as a more open, flexible ally who values justice over procedure.","personality_traits":["disciplined","secretive","blunt","principled"],"abilities":[{"name":"Anchor Inspection","description":"She can read stress, wear, and tampering on a cloudstone cable or anchor at a glance.","category":"technological"},{"name":"Shielded Forge Craft","description":"She is trained to work cloudstone safely using shielded forge-pits only.","category":"technological"}]}],"relationships":[{"id":"rel_odette_tobias_ally","source_character_id":"chr_odette_marsh","target_character_id":"chr_tobias_finch","relationship_type":"ally","description":"Odette Marsh takes the suspected Tobias Finch under her wing, recognising his innocence and relying on his grain-ledger skills to expose the forgery."},{"id":"rel_lucian_odette_enemy","source_character_id":"chr_lucian_vane","target_character_id":"chr_odette_marsh","relationship_type":"enemy","description":"Lucian Vane sees Odette Marsh's quiet questioning as a threat and works to mislead and isolate her, amplifying the conflict at the manor."},{"id":"rel_lucian_tobias_antagonist","source_character_id":"chr_lucian_vane","target_character_id":"chr_tobias_finch","relationship_type":"rival","description":"Lucian Vane exploits Tobias Finch's trust over the grain levy and tries to frame him for the murder to protect Cartel interests."},{"id":"rel_marguerite_lucian_rival","source_character_id":"chr_marguerite_quill","target_character_id":"chr_lucian_vane","relationship_type":"rival","description":"Marguerite Quill suspects Lucian Vane of skimming Cartel toll money meant for bridge upkeep, deepening the Toll War tension between them."},{"id":"rel_marguerite_odette_ally","source_character_id":"chr_marguerite_quill","target_character_id":"chr_odette_marsh","relationship_type":"ally","description":"Marguerite Quill, a fellow bridge professional, gradually shares her inspection findings with Odette Marsh, forming a cautious alliance to expose the culprit."}]}
