name":"Tobin Rusk","role":"antagonist","description":"A broad, soft-spoken Drift Cartel levy collector in his fifties, with a sun-cracked face and a ledger chained to his belt. Tobin rides the cabin's supply route monthly and has quietly profited from silencing inconvenient voices who report on Cartel shipments.","home_location_id":"loc_mistral_docks","faction_id":"fac_drift_cartel","motivation":"To protect his Cartel standing and the hidden debts he has hidden in forged wind-debt records.","goal":"Force Mara off the air before her broadcast exposes the falsified levy tallies.","flaw":"Greed that blinds him to consequences beyond the next quarter's collection.","internal_conflict":"He resents the Cartel that owns him yet cannot imagine a life without its protection.","external_conflict":"The Hollow Circle's resistance to the Grain Levy threatens to expose his forged ledgers, and Mara's broadcast could amplify that resistance.","arc":"Tobin starts as a polite, deniable enforcer who believes he can quietly buy Mara's silence. When the Hollow Circle refuses the levy and Mara airs his tallies, he is forced to confront the cabin in person. He ends exposed and stripped of Cartel protection, finally paying the debts he spent years hiding.","personality_traits":["polite","calculating","greedy","patient"],"abilities":[{"name":"Ledger Forgery","description":"Alters wind-debt and levy records so convincingly that auditors rarely catch the changes.","category":"other"},{"name":"Cartel Leverage","description":"Calls on Drift Cartel shipping lanes to delay or deny supplies to any settlement.","category":"social"}]},{"id":"chr_elsbeth_harrow","name":"Elsbeth Harrow","role":"supporting","description":"A wiry Hollow Circle miller in her sixties with flour-dusted forearms and a limp from a windmill accident. She delivers grain and tinned goods to Mara's cabin and is the only neighbour who still visits.","home_location_id":"loc_the_hollow","faction_id":"fac_hollow_circle","motivation"