 cable frays mid-crossing and Marra's crew holds the line without any open flame near the bridge, she sees merchants as allies. She ends by co-designing a fair toll-for-labour exchange with the caravan.","personality_traits":["disciplined","blunt","meticulous","protective"],"abilities":[{"name":"Cloudstone Braiding","description":"Braids and splices cloudstone cable to repair skybridges.","category":"technological"},{"name":"Structural Insight","description":"Spots stress faults in a bridge by sight and sound.","category":"mental"}]},{"id":"chr_corvin_dray","name":"Corvin Dray","description":"A smooth-spoken Drift Cartel factor at Mistral Docks, in his fifties, with rings on every finger and a ledger he never lets out of reach. He rose from a dockhand and now enforces the grain levy.","role":"antagonist","home_location_id":"loc_mistral_docks","faction_id":"fac_drift_cartel","motivation":"To secure his seat among the Cartel's merchant princes and never be poor again.","goal":"Collect the Grain Levy in full and force the caravan to carry Cartel cargo.","flaw":"Greed and fear of losing status make him ruthless with those weaker than him.","internal_conflict":"He remembers his dockhand past and secretly sympathises with small traders but suppresses it.","external_conflict":"Rival princes and the Wardens' resistance threaten his position as the Toll War escalates.","arc":"Corvin starts as a levy enforcer who crushes small traders for status. When Marra's shared route exposes his falsified levy tallies to the Cartel's own princes, he must choose between covering up and confessing. He ends by quietly cancelling the levy on the Hollow shipments, trading his rank for a measure of redemption.","personality_traits":["charming","calculating","ambitious","guarded"],"abilities":[{"name":"Ledger Craft","description":"Manipulates accounts and contract terms to the Cartel's advantage.","category":"social"}]},{"id":"chr_ilsa_quillfern","name":"Ilsa Quillfern","description":"A young cartographer from Silverspine Academy, ink-stained and bespectacled, who joins the caravan to chart the shifting skybridge network. She keeps a leather folio of half-finished maps.","role":"supporting","home_location_id":"loc_silverspine","faction_id":"fac_bridge_wardens","motivation":"To complete the first accurate chart of the drifting skybridges.","goal":"Map a safe route through the Toll War zones for the caravan.","flaw":"She is absent-minded and puts her maps ahead of the safety of her companions.","internal_conflict":"She wants scholarly neutrality yet is drawn to take a side in the Toll War.","external_conflict":"Academy elders forbid sharing maps with merchants and the Cartel wants to buy her charts.","arc":"Ilsa begins as an aloof scholar who hoards her unfinished maps. When the caravan is stranded between collapsing bridges, she shares her charts openly and guides everyone out. She ends as a cartographer who publishes free route maps for the common good.","personality_traits":["curious","distracted","brilliant","idealistic"],"abilities":[{"name":"Route Charting","description":"Charts shifting skybridge routes and predicts their drift.","category":"mental"}]}],"relationships":[{"id":"rel_marra_corvin_rivals","source_character_id":"chr_marra_venn","target_character_id":"chr_corvin_dray","relationship_type":"rival","description":"Marra Venn and Corvin Dray are rivals: Corvin uses the Cartel's levy and tolls to pressure Marra into carrying his cargo, and Marra resists him."},{"id":"rel_marra_tobin_mentor","source_character_id":"chr_marra_venn","target_character_id":"chr_tobin_ashgrove","relationship_type":"mentor","description":"Marra Venn mentors Tobin Ashgrove, teaching him the caravan trade while his trust in strangers keeps putting her load at risk."},{"id":"rel_selene_marra_wary","source_character_id":"chr_selene_ironbraid","target_character_id":"chr_marra_venn","relationship_type":"rival","description":"Selene Ironbraid distrusts Marra Venn as a Cartel-linked merchant, creating friction over tolls and bridge repairs until a shared crossing makes them allies."},{"id":"rel_corvin_tobin_enemy","source_character_id":"chr_corvin_dray","target_character_id":"chr_tobin_ashgrove","relationship_type":"enemy","description":"Corvin Dray targets Tobin Ashgrove's family mill with the Grain Levy, pitting the Cartel against the Hollow Circle."},{"id":"rel_ilsa_selene_ally","source_character_id":"chr_ilsa_quillfern","target_character_id":"chr_selene_ironbraid","relationship_type":"ally","description":"Ilsa Quillfern and Selene Ironbraid are Warden allies who trade bridge survey data, though Ilsa's carelessness frustrates Selene."}]}
